8c23b0f782a9a7cd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"上\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">上海书评</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>郑和下西洋不是为了开拓，而是为了证明一个篡位者的合法性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">葛剑雄认为，郑和下西洋的真实目的不是探索或贸易，而是篡位者朱棣借海外朝贡证明自己的皇位合法性，这和哥伦布单纯追逐黄金、土地的经济动机截然不同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海洋史</span><span class=\"tag\">郑和下西洋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Anne of Brittany proxy marriage book of hours Estates of Brittany\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-stuffmissed-安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国-死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>安妮公爵夫人三次联姻周旋法国，死后十八年布列塔尼还是被吞并</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安妮一生三次嫁人、两次加冕法国王后，用婚姻条款逼法国承认布列塔尼的独立地位，但她死后国王还是违背她的遗愿，把布列塔尼并入了法国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治联姻</span><span class=\"tag\">布列塔尼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scott Kupor on Building a16z and Rebuilding the Federal Workforce OPM GS-14 permissioned risk time-in-grade phalanx\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-a16z-美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>美国政府退休审批最后一步是邮寄进宾州一座地下矿洞人工翻档</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">退休申请走完所有流程后，纸质件要被送进宾夕法尼亚一座废弃石灰岩矿洞人工归档——卡住它的不是技术，是没人愿意为改善系统去承担被国会问责的风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Retelling history in art and drama Joint Stock corpsing Boko Haram\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-startweek-今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守-不是更开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>今天的英国剧场比1970年代更保守，不是更开放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">《云的九种形态》导演坦言：如今英国新剧远比1970年代更拘谨，复排时特意将后半段处理成一出年代戏，因为那种坦率尺度已经回不去了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殖民历史</span><span class=\"tag\">戏剧改编</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"宏观经济如何传导给我们每个人？ R&lt;G convenience yield paradox of thrift negative beta\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-09-mianji-这轮全球失衡不是宏观问题-根源是ai资本开支狂潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df0264fae5d8abe9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>这轮全球失衡不是宏观问题，根源是AI资本开支狂潮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国扩大AI资本开支推高投资、股市繁荣拉动消费，储蓄降、投资升，这才是本轮全球失衡加剧的真正驱动力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观经济</span><span 